---
import Enterprise from '../layouts/Enterprise.astro';
---
<Enterprise
  title="Privacy Policy — Mobile Offload | Goolsby Ventures LLC"
  description="Privacy notice for MobileOffload, operated by Goolsby Ventures LLC, including form processing, analytics, service providers, and contact information."
  navLinks={[
    { href: '/carrier-offload/', label: 'Learn' },
    { href: '/about/', label: 'About' },
    { href: '#main', label: 'Privacy' },
  ]}
  ctaHref="/network-assessment/"
>
  <main id="main" class="privacy-shell">
    <section class="privacy-section">
      <div class="privacy-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="privacy-inner">

        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="privacy-head">
          <div class="privacy-kicker">
            Legal
          </div>
          <h1>
            Privacy Policy
          </h1>
          <p class="privacy-date">
            Effective Date: April 8, 2026 &nbsp;·&nbsp; Last Updated: October 26, 2026
          </p>
          <div class="policy-notice">
            <p>
              Operational disclosure draft: updated to reflect the services currently present in this site's source. Owner and legal review are required before production publication.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Body -->
        <div class="prose-custom">

          <h2>1. Who We Are</h2>
          <p>
            Mobile Offload is a service operated by <strong>Goolsby Ventures LLC</strong>, a California limited liability company
            located at 19277 Sellins View Court, Redding, California 96003. Goolsby Ventures LLC is the primary business entity
            responsible for all operations, data handling, and contractual relationships associated with the Mobile Offload platform.
          </p>
          <p>
            Mobile Offload operates in partnership with <strong>Hudson House</strong>, which serves as a brokerage partner in
            facilitating carrier offload network agreements. Hudson House does not independently collect, store, or process
            end-user personal data submitted through this website.
          </p>

          <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>When you submit a qualification form or contact us, we may collect:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Your name and business name</li>
            <li>Email address and phone number</li>
            <li>Business address and venue type</li>
            <li>Estimated daily foot traffic</li>
            <li>Any additional details you voluntarily provide in the message field</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            The site also uses analytics and measurement scripts that may collect device, browser, network, referring-page,
            page-view, and interaction information. The precise identifiers and retention rules depend on each provider's
            configuration and should be confirmed by the site owner.
          </p>

          <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <p>Information you provide is used solely to:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Evaluate whether your location qualifies for the Mobile Offload carrier network program</li>
            <li>Contact you about your inquiry and next steps</li>
            <li>Send program updates if you have opted in</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            We will never use your information for unrelated marketing, and we will never sell or transfer it to data brokers,
            advertisers, or third-party marketers.
          </p>

          <h2>4. Service Providers and Limited Disclosures</h2>
          <p>
            Information may be processed by service providers that support the website, lead intake, analytics, measurement,
            communications, and any later program evaluation. Current source code identifies the following categories:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>
              <strong>LeadConnector / GoHighLevel:</strong> Network-assessment form submissions are sent to a LeadConnector
              webhook for lead intake and follow-up.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Google:</strong> Google Analytics is loaded for page and interaction measurement, and Google Fonts is
              requested to render site typography.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>OpenAI measurement:</strong> An OpenAI measurement script is currently loaded on site pages. Its
              configuration, data fields, purpose, and retention require owner verification. A previously configured IDPixel
              script was disabled pending an approved consent and data-governance configuration.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Hudson House (Brokerage Partner):</strong> As our brokerage partner, Hudson House may receive the minimum
              information necessary to facilitate a carrier agreement on your behalf. This is disclosed to you prior to any
              such sharing and is subject to the same confidentiality standards.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Program or network parties:</strong> If you proceed beyond assessment, business contact and site
              information may be disclosed as described in the applicable proposal, consent, or agreement.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Legal Compliance:</strong> We may disclose information if required to do so by law or in response to
              a valid legal process (e.g., court order or subpoena).
            </li>
          </ul>

          <h2>5. Data Security</h2>
          <p>
            The published site uses TLS/HTTPS in transit. Network-assessment forms are sent to a LeadConnector webhook.
            Storage location, access controls, retention, deletion, backup, and onward integrations in that account require
            confirmation by the site owner and should be reflected in the final policy.
          </p>
          <p>
            Security controls for any proposed carrier-offload deployment are separate from this website. They should be
            documented and tested for the specific site, equipment, configuration, and program.
          </p>

          <h2>6. Cookies & Tracking</h2>
          <p>
            This website currently loads Google Analytics and an OpenAI measurement pixel. These services
            may use cookies, local storage, pixels, or similar technologies depending on their configuration. The owner should
            complete a provider-by-provider data inventory, configure consent where required, and identify applicable opt-out
            mechanisms before production publication.
          </p>

          <h2>7. Your Rights</h2>
          <p>You have the right to:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Request a copy of any personal data we hold about you</li>
            <li>Request correction of inaccurate information</li>
            <li>Request deletion of your information from our records</li>
            <li>Opt out of any future communications at any time</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            To exercise any of these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:corey@mobileoffload.com">corey@mobileoffload.com</a>.
            We will respond within 10 business days.
          </p>

          <h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>
          <p>
            This website is intended for business owners and operators and is not directed at individuals under the age of 18.
            We do not knowingly collect personal information from minors.
          </p>

          <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
          <p>
            We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected on this page with an updated
            effective date. Continued use of the website following any changes constitutes your acceptance of the revised policy.
          </p>

          <h2>10. Contact Us</h2>
          <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or how your data is handled, please contact us:</p>
          <div class="contact-block">
            <p><strong>Goolsby Ventures LLC</strong><br/>
            Operating as: Mobile Offload<br/>
            19277 Sellins View Court<br/>
            Redding, California 96003</p>
            <p>
              Phone: <a href="tel:+15302324445">(530) 232-4445</a><br/>
              Email: <a href="mailto:corey@mobileoffload.com">corey@mobileoffload.com</a>
            </p>
            <p>Brokerage Partner: Hudson House</p>
          </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Back link -->
        <div class="privacy-back">
          <a href="/">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M19 12H5M12 5l-7 7 7 7"/>
            </svg>
            Back to Home
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Enterprise>

<style>
  .privacy-shell {
    background: var(--paper);
  }
  .privacy-section {
    position: relative;
    padding: 132px 0 96px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .privacy-glow {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 34% at 50% 0%, rgba(11,65,194,0.09) 0%, transparent 72%);
  }
  .privacy-inner {
    position: relative;
    width: min(100% - 40px, 780px);
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
  .privacy-head {
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }
  .privacy-kicker {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 7px 11px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(11,65,194,0.24);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(11,65,194,0.07);
    color: var(--blue);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .privacy-head h1 {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 5.5rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    line-height: 0.95;
  }
  .privacy-date {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-family: var(--sans);
  }
  .policy-notice {
    margin-top: 24px;
    padding: 18px 20px;
    border: 1px solid #d59b31;
    background: #fff8e8;
  }
  .policy-notice p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #68450c;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .privacy-back {
    margin-top: 48px;
  }
  .privacy-back a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    min-height: 44px;
    color: var(--blue);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .prose-custom {
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .prose-custom h2 {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .prose-custom p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .prose-custom ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .prose-custom ul li {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    position: relative;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .prose-custom ul li::before {
    content: '—';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--blue);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .prose-custom strong {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .prose-custom a {
    color: var(--blue);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  .prose-custom a:hover {
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .prose-custom .contact-block {
    background: var(--white);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule-dark);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .prose-custom .contact-block p {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .prose-custom .contact-block p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .privacy-section { padding: 104px 0 72px; }
    .privacy-inner { width: min(100% - 32px, 780px); }
    .privacy-head { margin-bottom: 36px; }
    .prose-custom h2 { margin-top: 2rem; }
  }
</style>
